WEBVTT

00:00:08.134 --> 00:00:09.385
[laughs]

00:00:11.929 --> 00:00:14.015
Did I sell it or did I sell it?

00:00:14.515 --> 00:00:16.559
Are you gonna tell us
what this is all about?

00:00:16.643 --> 00:00:18.144
Yeah, 'cause I don't feel dead.

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:19.270
And who are the suits?

00:00:19.354 --> 00:00:24.192
And why are they wearing
sunglasses inside? Hmm?

00:00:24.275 --> 00:00:26.361
I know. I know it seems elaborate,

00:00:26.444 --> 00:00:31.449
but trust me, it's the best way
if you wanna do some serious good.

00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:33.534
Gentlemen. Ladies.

00:00:33.618 --> 00:00:36.162
You have been identified
as ideal candidates

00:00:36.245 --> 00:00:38.039
for a brand-new, ultra-elite unit

00:00:38.122 --> 00:00:40.249
of secret operatives that we're calling

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:43.878
the International Super-Galactic
League of Protectors.

00:00:44.796 --> 00:00:46.089
ISGLOP.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:48.800
-Huh?
-Sounds kinda made-up.

00:00:48.883 --> 00:00:50.677
I don't understand.
What-- What's happening?

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.178
We're offering you a job, son.

00:00:52.261 --> 00:00:54.931
You're gonna be secret agents!

00:00:55.014 --> 00:00:56.015
Huh?

00:00:56.599 --> 00:00:58.184
-Is he serious?
-That can't be right.

00:00:58.267 --> 00:01:00.269
Secret agents? Get outta here.

00:01:00.353 --> 00:01:01.979
They're serious? Really?

00:01:02.063 --> 00:01:03.064
That's what I'm talking about!

00:01:03.147 --> 00:01:04.148
-Nice!
-[Piranha] All right!

00:01:04.232 --> 00:01:05.608
[exciting music playing]

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:32.510
Hey, almost forgot you were there.

00:01:32.593 --> 00:01:34.804
As you might have noticed,
change isn't easy.

00:01:35.304 --> 00:01:38.516
Some days it's gonna feel
downright hopeless.

00:01:39.934 --> 00:01:42.603
<i>But with the right attitude
and the right friends,</i>

00:01:43.521 --> 00:01:46.023
the good life has a way of finding you.

00:01:46.107 --> 00:01:48.901
Ready to get to work, Agent Wolf?

00:01:49.819 --> 00:01:52.572
Not bad. Not bad at all.

00:01:59.537 --> 00:02:01.831
["Goodlife" playing]

00:04:48.581 --> 00:04:49.999
[music fades]

00:04:50.082 --> 00:04:52.335
[Marmalade screaming]

00:04:54.712 --> 00:04:56.339
[laughing]

00:05:05.139 --> 00:05:09.352
[sighs] I love it
when a plan comes together.

00:05:09.435 --> 00:05:11.854
And now, time to go home.

00:05:11.938 --> 00:05:12.939
[engine starts]

00:05:13.022 --> 00:05:14.482
[Marmalade cackles]

00:05:20.905 --> 00:05:22.615
["Taking Everything" playing]

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:25.079
Well, bye!

